        <title type="html"><![CDATA[fix(css/display): clarify box suppression comment]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40088</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40088"/>
        <updated>2025-06-25T23:10:39.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12285999?u=183d27a6aca0718cb83ecec3c8e7745502384f48&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>

<p dir="auto">Updated a comment in the CSS <code class="notranslate">display</code> property syntax section from <code class="notranslate">/* box generation */</code> to <code class="notranslate">/* Box suppression */</code> to align with CSS specification terminology.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>

<p dir="auto">This change improves accuracy and clarity by reflecting the intended behavior of <code class="notranslate">display: none</code> and <code class="notranslate">display: contents</code>, which suppress box generation rather than initiate it. This aligns the documentation with current CSS specs and helps developers better understand box model behavior.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">See <a href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-display/#box-suppress" rel="nofollow">CSS Display Module Level 3</a> for reference on "box suppression".</p>

<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #40076.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3175121511" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40076" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/40076/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40076">#40076</a></p>



]]></content>
