<p dir="auto">Updated the usage note regarding Firefox behavior with Ctrl + Shift + X to reflect that recent versions now update the <code class="notranslate">dir</code> attribute when used inside a <code class="notranslate">&lt;textarea&gt;</code>.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">The previous note incorrectly stated that Firefox does not update the <code class="notranslate">dir</code> attribute. This fix improves accuracy for developers referencing MDN when handling text direction and writing modes.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">Behavior verified in recent versions of Firefox on Windows, where toggling text direction in a &lt;textarea&gt; using the shortcut also updates the dir attribute on the element.</p>
