        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF141 adds support for <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/IntersectionObserver" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">IntersectionObserver.scrollMargin</code></a> in <a href="https://https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1860030" rel="nofollow">https://https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1860030</a>.</p>
